## Notes
- Arrow shafts give ~375 XP per log (with bonus XP)
- Shortbows can be made at level 5.

## Per-Log XP Comparison (this server's bonus-XP multiplier, observed)
- Arrow shafts (15 per log): ~187 XP/log, takes longer to resolve (~6-40 ticks)
- Shortbow (1 per log, level 5+): ~125 XP/log
- **Longbow (1 per log, level 10+): ~250 XP/log in as few as 6 ticks (~0.6s) — best XP/action AND best XP/second.** Use longbow over arrow shafts once level 10 is reached.

## CRITICAL: The "Make X" Knife+Logs Dialog is Flaky

`bot.fletchLogs()` frequently returns `"Fletching timed out"` even though the dialog opened correctly. Root cause: the production dialog (componentIds in the 8880-8898 range, "What would you like to make?") sometimes silently drops the FIRST click — no error, no state change, dialog just sits open. Symptoms when it's stuck: `dialog.isWaiting` stays `true` indefinitely, repeated clicks (sendClickDialog, sendClickComponent, sendClickComponentWithOption — all tried) do nothing.

